* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

# `composer create-project` unpacks this archive, and the site needs all of it, its CI workflow included.
# A stray composer.lock stays out: it would pin every new site to an old Kami. A site commits its own.
/composer.lock export-ignore
# The kit's own checks, Kami's Smoke and the generators, are no site's.
/.github/workflows/kit.yml export-ignore
